  "description": "MIFZIM crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C55 H70 Dy4 N5 O22 3+,0.5(C6 H6),5(C5 H5 N1),H2 O1,3(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.545-4.520 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.97-144.34°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C83H100O23N10Cl3Dy4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
